Before 17 August 2026, material in this repository was offered under CC BY-NC 4.0. Rights already granted under that license for copies received under those terms are not revoked by this notice. New revisions and newly added material first distributed under this notice are governed by this notice unless an explicit file-level license says otherwise.

7. Third-party material

Third-party software, source-language material, trademarks, quotations, and other third-party content remain subject to their own licenses and rights. This notice grants no rights that Metkagram does not own or control.

8. No warranty

The repository and website are provided as available and without warranties to the extent permitted by law.

For a practical rights summary, research-use process, and licensing options, see LICENSING.md and docs/RESEARCH_USE.md.
